@startuml calendar-year-states
!pragma layout smetana
title Training calendar year states
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

[*] --> DRAFT : administrator creates the year\nor imports the bundled list
DRAFT --> CONFIRMED : administrator confirms\n(at least one holiday and a source)
CONFIRMED --> DRAFT : a holiday date is added, moved\nor removed (after the impact list)
CONFIRMED --> CONFIRMED : a holiday is renamed
note right of DRAFT
  Applications with training days
  in a DRAFT year are refused.
end note
@enduml
